        "original_id": "a6e1bed5-1928-5551-a174-be05b046f446",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Mandalay Resort Group, Circus Circus Enterprises, MGM Resorts International, RBG, LLP, Hyatt\n- Places: Paradise, Nevada, Las Vegas, Elgin\n- Properties: Circus Circus Las Vegas, Grand Victoria Casino Elgin\n\nFacts:\n- Mandalay Resort Group, formerly known as Circus Circus Enterprises, was a hotel-casino operator based in Paradise, Nevada.\n- Circus Circus Las Vegas is owned and operated by MGM Resorts International.\n- In April 2005, MGM Resorts International acquired Mandalay Resort Group.\n- Grand Victoria Casino Elgin is 50% owned and operated by RBG, LLP, a subsidiary of Hyatt.\n- Grand Victoria Casino Elgin is 50% owned by a subsidiary of MGM Resorts International, which acquired Mandalay Resort Group, the former 50% partner company, in April 2005.",
